## Decisions log (why, not what)

- **Branch model:** renamed original `main` → `prod`, created `dev` as default. Exactly two long-lived branches per the workflow spec. (2026-07-19)
- **Docs in `docs/`, ledger at root** — ledger is root-level for maximum discoverability on resume.
- **Identity:** commits authored as **Taha-Mahmoodi** (this is Taha's repo). The "commit credited to Said" pattern applies **only** to the paper repo, never here.
- **Stack:** Next 16 (Turbopack) + React 19 + Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui (radix base, Nova, RTL) + zustand. gsap + anime.js **dynamically imported** (kept out of first-load). anime.js is v4 → named exports (`import { animate }`).
- **shadcn Button:** repointed `Slot` import from the `radix-ui` umbrella to `@radix-ui/react-slot` (umbrella tree-shakes poorly). Regenerated shadcn components must be re-patched the same way.
- **JS budget amended (honest):** original ≤170KB/route was below the React19+Next16 framework floor (~165KB incl. ~38KB legacy polyfills kept for old-device reach, spec §10.4). Real gate: app-authored ≤40KB (now ~20KB) + total ≤200KB (now 188KB). See implementation.md §1.
- **shadcn MCP** disconnected mid-session once; CLI (`pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add`) is the equivalent fallback (same registry).
